{"id": "EUVD-2026-106909", "enisaUuid": "22fbf60c-f331-3f99-b6c1-4589a0d73c91", "description": "HKUDS Vibe-Trading from 0.1.0 before 0.1.7 contains a path traversal vulnerability that allows remote attackers to read sensitive server files through LLM agent file-read tools. Attackers can prompt the agent to invoke read_document, which lacks sandbox checks, or safe_user_path-gated tools to leak /etc/shadow, /proc/self/environ API keys, and /root credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:37:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T00:37:06", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/security/advisories/GHSA-5rmq-chc7-m22f", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/hkuds-vibe-trading-0.1.0-before-0.1.7-path-traversal-via-read-document-and-safe-user-path"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c5xj-9gp4-c84p", "CVE-2026-114106"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "cbb5e9fb-2d1f-3810-bed0-d1fbb351b395", "product": {"name": "Vibe-Trading", "vendor": {"name": "HKUDS"}}, "product_version": "0.1.0 <0.1.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "83038cd0-4982-3b89-8fec-0e4c3e2fa869", "vendor": {"name": "HKUDS"}}], "isExploited": false}